pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: One definition to remember. Emphasize that domain experts are the stars — developers mostly listen today.
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 56, 400, 22]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      text: WHY WE ARE HERE
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 84, 780, 44]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: One wall, the whole story
  - elementId: def
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 156, 520, 110]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p>Event storming is a workshop where the <strong>whole team</strong> maps a business process as a <strong>timeline of events</strong> — sticky notes on one wall.</p>
  - elementId: why-list
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 290, 520, 110]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p><strong>Fast.</strong> Hours, not weeks of interviews and documents.</p>
        <p><strong>Shared.</strong> Business and tech discover the same picture together.</p>
        <p><strong>Honest.</strong> Gaps and disagreements surface as notes, not as bugs later.</p>
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 150, 1, 330]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#D8D2C8"}
  - elementId: leave-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [676, 156, 220, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      text: You will leave with
  - elementId: leave-list
    elementType: text
    bounds: [676, 196, 220, 260]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 13.5
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p>A timeline of everything that happens in our process</p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px">The open questions we must answer next</p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px">The natural seams between parts of the business</p>
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [900, 505, 40, 20]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "2"
